def binomial_Coeff(n, k):
    # Check if n and k are non-negative integers between 0 and n
    if not (0 <= k <= min(n, 10)):
        raise ValueError("n and k must be within the valid range")

    # Calculate binomial coefficient using formula
    return math.factorial(n) // (math.factorial(k) * math.factorial(n - k))
```

